@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1,Mouth1_Fearful_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかに私は……<br>元々は人間でした……。|#0205Trial02_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR3_1,ArmL3,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でも私はこの島で暮らして、<br>大魔女様に<br>認められたんです……！|#0205Trial02_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:大魔女様は<br>そんな私の身を案じて、<br>自分で身を守れるように<br>魔法を与えて<br>くださったんです……。|#0205Trial02_Meruru003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆喜び

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"そして私は魔女となって、<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_02_01\">大魔女様の家族</link>と<br>なりました！|#0205Trial02_Meruru004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Downcast_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……そのあと大魔女様は、<br>世界に呪いをバラまいたんです。|#0205Trial02_Meruru005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Downcast_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"人間たち同士で<br>永遠に争うように……<br>自身の魔女としての因子を<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_02_02\">植え付け</link>ました。|#0205Trial02_Meruru006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:とっても……可哀想です。<br>私も１人残されてしまって……<br>寂しかったです……。|#0205Trial02_Meruru007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でも大魔女様は<br>自身が消える直前に、<br>私に言い残しました……<br>【自身の存在を魔女因子に変える】<br>って……。|#0205Trial02_Meruru008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"だから私は……<br>大魔女様は魔女因子となって<br>人々の中に<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_02_03\">お隠れになった</link>……。<br>そう考え、<br>今も探し続けているんです。|#0205Trial02_Meruru009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

