@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:【魔法を操り、悪逆非道の限りを尽くす、異形】<br>……すなわち、想像上の【魔女】へ変える呪術。|#0205Trial02_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

